{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxRqrCNyoWRVWGZEgDg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's my answer, Psagot plus the IBI 125 tracker fund, and I'm stopping here. The page already gave it to me.\n\n**What I decided:** I'd open a trading account at פסגות and buy \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125 (4A)\", fund number 5112628, putting in 500 ₪ every month. After 10 years the page says I'd have **86,045 ₪** from **70,000 ₪** put in. I'm fairly sure, but not completely. What decided it was the account card on screen 2: \"הבחירה שלכם ★ הזול\" with 86,045 ₪ right under it. That's the biggest number, and the page calls it the cheapest. Psagot is a name I know from ads, so I'm fine with it.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n- **Screen 1:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\", the index buttons (ת\"א-125 was already picked) and the boxes \"סכום היום 10,000\" and \"הפקדה חודשית 500\". These are the page's amounts, not mine. My 30,000 isn't in there, and I can't move the slider from screenshots, so I left them.\n- **Screen 2:** the 7% return box, then the big numbers: 70,000 ₪ put in, 86,045 ₪ for Psagot and 85,015 ₪ for the next pair.\n- **Screen 3:** a coloured bar with a legend. Then \"פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ\" and \"מה החשבון גובה ב־10 שנים: 1,049 ₪\". That's fees in shekels, which I take seriously, and it's low.\n- **Screens 4–6:** the account list. Psagot was first, then לאומי, וואן זירו and הבינלאומי. Way down are אלטשולר and מיטב at about 63,000–65,000 ₪, with long red bars, so those are out. I didn't open any of the \"לא בחישוב\" folds.\n- **Screen 7:** the fund card. Management fee 0.1%, which sounds like nothing.\n- **Screen 8:** the other 125 funds (תכלית, הראל, קסם, and another IBI one). They all have minus numbers like \"−1,030 ₪\", so the one already picked looks best.\n- **Screen 9:** a chart with a lot of lines. I looked at it and stopped there.\n\n**What I skipped:** the grey paragraphs on screens 1 and 4, the \"מול המדד\" explanation at the bottom of screen 8, the \"אין נתון\" boxes for Interactive Brokers, and the rest of the page after the chart.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"דמי משמרת\", \"נאמן 0.025%\", \"משתנים 0%\", \"4A\", and \"קרן מחקה\" next to \"קרן סל\". I still don't know if those are different things. I also didn't get the purple dotted lines under the numbers.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- On my own fund it says \"−0.04% בשנה · שנה אחת\". A minus on the fund I'm about to buy is scary. Is it losing money?\n- The minus numbers on the other funds (\"−1,030 ₪\") look like losses. I guess they mean \"less than your pick\", but I'm not sure.\n- There are two IBI funds with almost the same name, \"מחקה\" and \"סל\". Easy to buy the wrong one, so I'd copy the number 5112628.\n- The colours on the bar in screen 3 sit far from their legend, so I guessed.\n- 86,045 ₪ is only 16,000 more than I put in over 10 years. I thought 7% a year would be about 70% more. The card says \"בכסף של היום\", which I think means after inflation, but I'm not sure.\n- The chart on screen 9 is where I'd have closed the page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1893,"cache_read_input_tokens":19204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1893},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47590677-4ec0-420c-a881-674a28f23152","uuid":"f8c9a1bc-98f8-4801-b229-7bfb1d0e27dd","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:03:06.533Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxRqT8TpLcjbj9KUfju"}
